{
  "bookId": "activity-snippets-tu2ye15",
  "id": "section-35010",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35010001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "快乐桃桃",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好可爱的桃子，贝歌，你做得太漂亮了~！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "没什么的，不过是按照「兔儿爷」讲述的步骤认真去完成。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "可是桃子的效果很棒呀，嘻嘻，优纪好想摸一摸~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "还没有完全做好，等……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊，我把桃子给戳了个洞……贝歌，我、我对不起你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "优纪怎么在哭鼻子，发生了什么事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呜，优纪把贝歌做好的桃桃给戳破了，呜呜呜呜……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "喂，只不过戳了一个浅浅的印子，没你说得那么夸张。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "这种程度的印子，米菲亚就可以复原，交给我喵~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "唔，谢谢……谢谢大家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35010012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "太好了，我会期待它修复后的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
